{%- comment -%}
  T1 (post-launch audit 30/09): the "Request physical catalogue" variant (a 0,00 € variant inside the
  Color option, 34 variants on 28 products) is no longer shown as a colour swatch. main-product and
  featured-product drop it from the Color <select>; this renders it as its own button instead.
  Detection = variant title contains "atalog"/"atálog" — matches the value in all 6 locales
  (catalogue · catálogo · catalogo · Katalog), 0 false positives on 30/09.
  GET {{ routes.cart_add_url }}?id=… adds the variant and 302s to the cart (verified 30/09, EN + /pt).
  PURE MOVE 1/2 have one catalogue variant per Style: the first one is used.
  Usage: {% render 'mf-catalogue-button', product: product %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign mf_cat = false
  for mf_v in product.variants
    assign mf_t = mf_v.title | downcase
    if mf_t contains 'atalog' or mf_t contains 'atálog'
      assign mf_cat = mf_v
      break
    endif
  endfor
  case request.locale.iso_code
    when 'pt'
      assign mf_cat_label = 'Pedir o catálogo físico'
    when 'fr'
      assign mf_cat_label = 'Demander le catalogue physique'
    when 'de'
      assign mf_cat_label = 'Physischen Katalog anfordern'
    when 'es'
      assign mf_cat_label = 'Solicitar el catálogo físico'
    when 'it'
      assign mf_cat_label = 'Richiedi il catalogo fisico'
    else
      assign mf_cat_label = 'Request the physical catalogue'
  endcase
-%}
{%- if mf_cat -%}
  <div class="mf-catalogue">
    <a class="button alt mf-catalogue__btn" rel="nofollow"
       href="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}?id={{ mf_cat.id }}&quantity=1">{{ mf_cat_label }}</a>
  </div>
  <style>
    .mf-catalogue { margin: 14px 0 4px; }
    .mf-catalogue__btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 44px; width: 100%; max-width: 100%; text-align: center; }
  </style>
{%- endif -%}
